WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
The Rival is Prince Kazune

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.910
Hanazono-san.

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:54.840
Karin-chan?

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:58.760
I'm sorry it's nothing.

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.760
Geez, what are you so mad about?

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.510
Oh don't tell me, it's about that kiss yesterday.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.890
That was just a greeting.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.690
That wasn't your first kiss, was it?

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.610
Geez! Micchi, you're an idiot.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.160
Eh? Then you've never kissed Kazune-kun?

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.370
W-Why would I do that with Kazune-kun?!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.500
Hmm… So that's how it is.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.500
Hey, Micchi.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:36.420
You said the man in that photo was professor Kujyou, right?

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.470
Himeka-chan and Kazune-kun are cousins.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:45.470
So it makes sense that their dads look similar.

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:50.430
But that picture…

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:54.600
it's the same one that I have of my parents.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.790
During homeroom today…

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.990
we should discuss out production for the Seiei School Arts Festival.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.660
Yes! Yes!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:09.580
I've got the best idea for the festival!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.200
It should be this amazing play.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.080
Eh? Wow! What's the story?

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:21.210
"Miyon's Theatre of Passionate Love"!

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:26.680
Once upon a time, there lived two princely brothers.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:30.310
One day, the older prince asked his magic mirror…

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.850
"Who is the most beautiful in the world?"

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.850
He wanted to know.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.270
The mirror replied,…

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.400
"That would be your brother!"

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:46.070
Upon hearing this, the older prince got really mad.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.910
He went into the mountains to harvest.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:53.660
While his brother did the laundry by the river.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:58.500
While the younger prince was doing laundry…

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:03.950
a giant poison apple floated right on by!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.890
The apple gave birth to a beautiful princess.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:14.320
Then the younger prince with a spindle and Seven Little Dwarves…

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.600
defeated his brother!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.230
He married the princess.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.360
Then lived happily ever after!

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:32.330
Well? Isn't it the most fantastic, dramatic script ever?

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.540
Umm… So it's about how both brothers want to be king?

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.960
The role of the prince and the princess…

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.510
would be perfect for Kujyou-kun and Hanazono-san!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.550
What are you saying, Micchi?!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.590
Are you stupid?

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:53.350
Umm… We haven't decided that we're doing Miyon's play yet.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.150
Hey, Kazune-kun…

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.360
What do you want?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.240
Will you tell me the rest of that story?

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.240
"That story"?

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:16.500
It's probably… an effect from Kirika's strange ring.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:19.710
Kazune-kun.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:21.460
You know something, don't you?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.670
Not really…

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.130
Because, at that time I'd almost lost consciousness.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:31.010
You know, I kissed Hanazono-san yesterday.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:36.680
You were unconscious and still sleeping.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.020
So what?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.520
Hmm? You're not mad?

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.190
What she does has nothing to do with me.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.110
I knew it, you are mad.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.910
I'm not mad!

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:00.080
I'm home!

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.830
Karin-chan, welcome home!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.380
Oh, that's Kazune-kun's pet bird…

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.680
C-Cute!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:17.390
Just now, you thought "Looks delicious", didn't you?

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.690
I would never think that!

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.440
Darn it. He found out.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:25.440
If that cat does something to it…

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.740
I will do more than just get angry!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.650
There's no way I'd do anything to it!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.870
Could it be that Kazune-kun is in a really bad mood?

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:42.040
Ah, Karin-chan! Welcome home.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.500
I'm home.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.590
Something smells really good.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:48.590
I'm baking a cake.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.010
A cake?!

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:57.390
It's a tofu cake to make Kazune-chan feel better.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:58.470
P-Please.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.730
Himeka-chan's good at this.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.520
She knows him really well.

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.690
I'm going to finish the…

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.190
cake so just wait a little, okay?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:27.380
I wonder if Kazune-kun likes Himeka-chan after all.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:31.960
That what he told Micchi and I was a lie.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.640
Was what Nishikiyori said… really true?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.600
What are you looking at?!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.770
R-Right back at you!

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.310
That picture…

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:50.270
I wonder if Kazune-kun knows something about it.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.870
Nishikiyori didn't seem that serious about it…

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.610
Maybe he was just messing with her?

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:05.160
- Hey! 
- Hey!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.590
W-What is it, Kazune-kun?

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.920
No, you go first.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.800
That's okay, you go.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:16.880
- Micchi said- 
- Nishikiyori said-

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.470
What?

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.260
You wanted to talk about Nishikiyori also?

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.470
You too?

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:26.350
Sorry, but I don't really want to hear it.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.980
Then, let me hear what you have to say.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.360
Just forget it.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.410
Wait! Why?

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.870
You're so persistent!

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:43.200
Hey, are you alright, Karin?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.580
Kazune-kun you…

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:48.540
Huh?

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.210
…idiot!

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.180
Kazune-kun you're always like this.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.670
Why do you never tell me anything?

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:59.640
Always keeping things to yourself.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.720
Even this morning!

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.480
I'm not Himeka-chan, okay?!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.180
I can't just notice a habit and suddenly know what you're thinking!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.690
That's why… That's why you have to tell me!

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:13.440
Habit?

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.450
So you saw us? This morning?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.740
I'm sorry. I…

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.040
Umm… well…

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:27.790
What would you know?!

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:37.840
What's wrong with you two?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.630
What's was that?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.300
Kazune-kun, you jerk!

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.060
I'm home, nii-san.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.680
Kirika, overnight stay?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.350
Overnight stay?

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.310
Don't worry… it's not like that.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:55.400
I found the ring you dropped in the park.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.440
You used it, didn't you?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:00.780
Well, whatever…

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.280
What matters is Himeka is feeling better today.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:10.710
I expect a full report from you later.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:13.790
This is…?

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.000
Details on the presentations for the school festival.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.920
There is a remarkable entry this year!

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:22.590
You got that, Kirika?

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:30.050
This is huge! Powerful! It's the mother of all! It's pure greatness! It's tremendous!!!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:33.820
Eh, I got it, nii-san… I'll read it later.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.400
Read it now! Right here, right now!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.860
"Miyon's Theatre of Passionate Love", right?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.330
What's wrong with them?

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:54.000
- They have been like that since yesterday.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.290
- Big news!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:59.840
They chose my play for the school festival!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.340
It was a big hit with the student council president!

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.840
Ah! Isn't that's great Miyon?!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:05.720
Yeah!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:09.190
We should probably cast Kazune-kun and Karin-chan as the leads.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.270
I think I should play the prince.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.230
I'd prefer to play the lead to Hanazono-san's princess.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.700
I think I'm more equipped than Kazune-kun…

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.740
to play prince to Hanazono-san's princess.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.580
Nishikiyori-kun as the prince, huh?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.740
Actually!!!

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.500
The role of the prince…

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.090
belongs to Kujyou-kun!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.090
He is such a driving force, that…

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:34.010
we, the Kazunezu...

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.710
will not accept this!

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:39.100
No… Even if you say that to me…

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:41.590
No, the one worthy of the role as the prince…

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.170
can only be Michiru-sama!

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.340
Who are you?!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.190
We are…

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.520
The protectors of Michiru-sama…

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.270
The loyal supporters…

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:53.940
That is, we are…

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.900
The Michirians!

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.820
W-What's with this? Fangirl Factions?

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.110
Well, then.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.580
Can I play the evil prince?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.330
And my princess shall be,…

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:14.120
Himeka!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:20.130
Huh? But the mean prince doesn't get a princess!

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.550
Then make a part up.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.590
N-No way…

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.130
Kujyou-kun as a villain?

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:29.390
That's even better!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.350
How sinfully delicious!

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.890
Let's do our best, Hanazono-san.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.730
Until this play ends… Consider us enemies!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:40.610
Wha-?!

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:41.570
Eh?

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.320
What is that?.. I'm so infuriated!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.450
If that's how you feel, then same here!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.950
Because I'm not going to lose!

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:54.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.260
I am God!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.220
You moron.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.220
It's a croquette!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:11.900
I am Princess Poisoned Apple born from a poisoned apple!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:14.160
Mirror, mirror…

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.860
who is the fairest of them all?

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.570
Amazing! You two!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.120
Huh? What's wrong, Nishikiyori-kun?

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.660
Nothing… Well you know-

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.340
Micchi!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.710
Have you memorized your lines yet?

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.640
Y-Yes! Of course!

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:38.590
Then, let's hear them.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:43.900
Let me see… O-Oh, what a beautiful princess-

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.760
What is that?!

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:47.150
S-Sorry!

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:50.150
It's no good if you always rely on the script!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.200
Who cares about the lines?!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.090
It's about putting heart into it! Heart!

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:59.740
You should speak with your own words or you'll never convey feelings to the audience!

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:03.750
But… we haven't practiced even once today…

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.830
Be quiet!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:09.330
You have to fight and win!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.610
- And what is this?!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.710
- I can't really say for sure but…

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:14.920
- O-Oh, what a beautif-

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.920
- How amazingly shallow.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:19.840
I won't lose!

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:22.130
I definitely won't lose!

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:25.060
Amenbo! Kai na A-I-U-E-O!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:28.470
Eel is delicious-nya!, nya-nya-nya!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.810
Kazune-kun! I won't lose!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.000
It's lacking something.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.290
Really? I think it suits you.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:49.700
Everyone, the student council president is coming!

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:57.750
So, this is your class, Kujyou.

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.050
Then, that means, Karin-chan is…

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.470
Entering with Hanazono-san!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:19.530
Alright! The real play is tomorrow. So you need to get your act together!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:22.200
Y-Yeah… I'll do my best.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.400
Good afternoon, Karin-chan.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.080
Thanks again for the other day.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.750
I-It's nothing…

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.790
The role of the princess really suits you.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:33.200
Thank you very much.

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:35.210
How's the play coming along?

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.330
I'm practicing hard every day.

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.290
It's already perfect!

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:42.720
Kazune-kun give the student council president a taste of what's to come!

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.300
Eh? No!

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:46.260
Don't be shy now.

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.060
Dear brother!

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.230
Unhand me!

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:55.980
No…

00:15:56.490 --> 00:16:01.190
I fear for you, dear brother.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.450
As expected of those two.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:05.820
They look good.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.740
But! I can too!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.370
I have always loved you, Sire.

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:15.580
Princess Poisoned Apple…

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:31.050
How was that, senpai?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:34.220
Eh… it was really good.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.270
But…

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:37.640
But I…

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.650
I loved that senpai!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:47.360
But... I suppose I've seen the "real" you…

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.490
I found it slightly lacking.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.790
But, we're looking forward to tomorrow's performance.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.120
Right, nii-san?

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:56.700
Yeah…

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.420
Is that mean…

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:03.670
we lack what Kazune-kun has?

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:07.340
The president was really happy!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:10.800
Let's do our best tomorrow, too! Right, Hanazono-san?

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:13.810
Hanazono-san?

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:31.700
- A-A-Am-Amenbo Atai na-

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:31.700
- Hey, Micchi…

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.870
I-I-I'm going to the river to do laundry!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.410
Is my Princess Poisoned Apple fake?

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:47.510
Is that what's been bothering you?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.840
It's not funny!

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:57.770
Senpai said it wasn't the real me.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:01.310
What am I doing wrong?

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:03.900
I worked so hard for this…

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.400
Not "real" enough, was it?

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.360
Long story short…

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:14.780
it means we're not convincing as a couple.

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:21.000
Which makes sense of course. Since we're not a real couple.

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:26.290
But our rivals, on the other hand.

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:34.590
Their honest caring for each other…

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.730
must be really showing through…

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:39.810
they're really putting their feelings into it.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.900
Huh? I wonder why…

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.350
Why am I crying?..

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:54.530
Why is this so frustrating?

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:56.490
It's alright.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:18:59.660
Micchi…

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:01.700
If you feel that strongly…

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.790
I'm sure you'll do well.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:07.090
Only… rather than looking at him during the play…

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:10.880
turn your feelings to me… if only for a moment.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:13.380
Who's "him"?

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:25.310
Micchi, I don't get you.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.360
You kissed me yesterday, but today…

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.730
You're acting like a good person.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.200
I can't tell if you're on my side or not.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:39.410
I want to say as professor Kujyou wanted me to be.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.330
That's all, really.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.250
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:45.330
Yeah!

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.670
And since we're bad at feigning love.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.500
Let's date to improve our stage authenticity.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:54.380
What are you saying?!

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.680
I'm home.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:03.680
Karin-chan, you're late.

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:06.350
Ah, sorry.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:09.860
Dinner's already been made.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:12.030
It's sashimi.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.780
I'm going to sleep now.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.910
Already?

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:23.290
Tell Kazune-chan that dinner's ready.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:27.210
Well, good night.

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.590
Himeka-chan looked really tired.

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:34.460
Kazune-kun?!

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:40.680
Kazune-kun!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:44.640
Stay away! Stay away!

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:46.770
A bug?

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:52.020
That stupid bug.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.150
It attacked me the second I was immobilized.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:58.360
What were you doing under a mountain of books anyway?

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:00.570
It's not like I wanted to be there.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.910
I was researching about lots of stuff.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:07.370
I was also thinking about Nishikiyori.

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:08.830
About Micchi?

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:10.380
Yeah, like I thought, he's-

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.380
Wait.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:20.720
I know that you think Micchi might be an enemy… I…

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:22.470
I'm sure you'll do well.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:25.520
I don't think that he is a bad person!

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:27.350
Same here.

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:32.650
We should get him on our side…

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:33.730
is what I was thinking.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.820
Eh… but…

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:40.070
You know… He doesn't have anything to hold him back.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:42.410
That's why I let him pair up with you.

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:44.450
I wanted to watch him during rehearsals.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:47.290
Huh? Is that so?

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:51.620
I'm sorry… I shouldn't have picked so many fights.

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:55.460
I thought you were really into the play.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.340
Sure, I'm into it.

00:21:57.680 --> 00:21:59.840
I thought you were my rival.

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.930
What did you say?!

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:10.640
It always happens when I'm alone.

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:13.600
I only think about the bad stuff.

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:15.820
It's tiring, you know?

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:19.530
But…

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:22.700
When I am with you and we're fighting like kids…

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:25.450
it makes me really…

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:28.450
K-Kazune-kun?

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:09.970
The Theatre of Passionate Love waits for No One
